Ownership and permissions
=========================

The code in this repository is not my own work. It is a modified copy of parts of
"RSE - Shoulder Or Saddle", created by Hunk92:

  - Nexus Mods: https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/170232
  - Original source: https://github.com/Hunk92/RSE-Shoulder-Or-Saddle

All rights to the original code, scripts and mod remain with Hunk92. The original source does not state a licence;
the terms that apply are the permissions given by the author on the Nexus Mods page of the mod, which explicitly
allow modifying its files and releasing bug fixes.

This repository only contains the files modified by the unofficial patch, with the fixes clearly marked
("FIX patch" comments). It is published so that anyone can check what was changed, and so that the original
author can freely take these fixes back into the mod.

The French translation file in Translation/French/ is a repaired copy of the original French translation of the
mod; its content belongs to its translator.

Third-party components
----------------------

The SKSE plugins are built with CommonLibSSE-NG (https://github.com/alandtse/CommonLibSSE-NG), licensed under
GPL-3.0-or-later with a Modding Exception. Its licence applies to that library and is not changed by this notice.

Patch modifications: Kroosstii.
